  {
   "id": "pneumata-223183@major-2024-09-28",
   "gameId": "pneumata-223183",
   "displayName": "First Update Out Now - Save Issues and Localization",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-28T06:04:36.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Antonio here, the developer for Pneumata.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've been taking a careful look at all the feedback and working hard on getting patches out for the various issues encountered within the game. I'm committed to fixing core issues, as well as general updates and improvements to the overall experience of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The first patch will go live today on 09/27/2024 at 10:00am PST.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue with save data related to the island being lost",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue with save data from previous runs affecting a new playthrough",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Localization now live for the first set of languages:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "French",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "German",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Italian",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spanish",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Portuguese: I'm working hard to roll out these updates in a timely manner and will be working towards consistent updates, but as a solo dev I also want to be careful about rushing updates. Keep an eye out for more news/updates regarding upcoming patches and improvements coming very soon.: Thank you to everyone for supporting the game, even through a difficult launch. I plan to take all the feedback and address the issues and concerns relating to the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
